{'symbol': 'TTWO', 'date': '2022-03-22 16:44:00', 'title': 'KASKELA LAW LLC ANNOUNCES STOCKHOLDER INVESTIGATION OF TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC. AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS TO CONTACT THE FIRM - TTWO', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA , MARCH 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KASKELA LAW LLC ANNOUNCES THAT IT IS INVESTIGATING TAKE-TWO INTERACTIVE SOFTWARE, INC. ("TAKE-TWO") (NASDAQ: TTWO) ON BEHALF OF THE COMPANY\'S STOCKHOLDERS. ON JANUARY 10, 2022, TAKE-TWO\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAD ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE ZYNGA IN A CASH AND STOCK TRANSACTION VALUED AT $9.86 PER ZYNGA SHARE.'}